# EmailJS — https://dashboard.emailjs.com
# Create a service (e.g. Gmail) + a template with {{name}}, {{email}}, {{message}} variables,
# then copy the three IDs below. The public key is safe to expose client-side by design.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
